# Exports that kernelbase.dll forwards to kernel32.dll.
#
# On ReactOS the implementation of these Windows 10 kernelbase.dll exports
# lives in kernel32.dll, so kernelbase.dll just forwards them (see the
# kernelbase.def generation in CMakeLists.txt). The reference list of what
# Windows' kernelbase.dll exports is wine/kernelbase.spec; an entry belongs
# here only if it is in that list, is NOT already exported by
# kernelbase_ros.spec, and kernel32.spec exports it as a real (non-stub)
# function. CMake verifies at configure time that every name below is exported
# by kernel32.spec, so a stale entry fails the configure instead of producing
# a dangling forwarder.
#
# Format: @ <name> [-version=<min>+ | -version=<min>-<max>] [-arch=<list>]
# The version/arch gate is copied from the kernel32.spec entry.
